description=Brings PICO optical hand tracking and Quest-style hand passthrough to the unmodified official Virtual Desktop on PICO 4 and PICO 4 Pro, with an eye-gaze pointer fix on supported hardware. Experimental; needs root + Zygisk. Does not modify the APK.
